              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Aron esacaradoti tolot a nen Moru Or ikwapei alimunitor Ekapolon, ido abu totwan aina. Atwani Aron erae ŋirwa ke elap epei, elap ŋolo a ŋikan alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniomwon kelomut Ŋisirael alo Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
