              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Negeb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "iŋes atemar ewae ŋolo alo Kwap",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anakwap a Kanaan, kiira atemar eponito Ŋisirael.",
