          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kirwor neni a Moses anadipoe a ŋuna a Moab alodiyete Yorodan aneni iteosi ka Yeriko tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kirwor neni a Ŋisirael, tolimok ikes ebe, ‘Ani ituborosi iyes lowae ye Yorodan, nakwap ŋina a Kanaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina iyes kiritasi ŋituŋa ŋulu iboiyete anakwap a ŋina ilosete iyes ka kinyasut ŋitorubei ŋulu icieto ikes, kinyasut ŋitorubei a ŋakujo kec ŋulu icietae a ŋamoru ka ŋulu itiyatae a ŋasuwa ka tomunaasi ŋakiboisyo kec ŋuna eya nenimukur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikamarete iyes akwap ŋin, ido kiboikinos nen, anerae akainak ayoŋ iyes akwap ŋin toruwor ŋina kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes tokorakis akwap lotuŋa a ŋinateker anakilamilam; ateker ŋina elalak ŋituŋa keŋ emaikina iyes inakis akwap ŋina alalan ka ateker ŋina ekudyoko ŋituŋa keŋ, inakisi akwap ŋina edit. Akwap daadaŋ ŋina eryamuni ituŋanan anakilamilam, eruwor ŋina keŋ; eruwor akwap ŋin ŋina kus a ŋikabilae atapapaa kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani pa kiritasi iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu sek iboiyete anakwap a ŋin, ido kimyekis kidoŋo ŋice, ikiteryamunete ikes iyes ŋican lopite ŋolo ikiteryamunia anyait ŋina eyai nakoŋu, kori ekukwae ŋolo eyai nakuwan ŋican. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi pa kiritasi iyes ŋituŋa ŋul etiyae ayoŋ neni kus ŋuna sek ayeunit ayoŋ akitiya neni kec.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
